{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#card-zh","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉识别插件，提供图片 OCR 工具和设置页配置卡片。它在宿主侧注册 ocr_recognize 工具，并在浏览器设置的插件区域提供可折叠卡片。工具读取 PNG、JPEG、GIF 或 WebP 图片，调用 OpenAI 兼容或 Anthropic 格式的视觉模型，返回识别文字、置信度以及像素或百分比坐标；遇到低置信度文字时可按区域重新识别并合并结果，也可指定区域或补充识别提示。适合需要从截图、扫描图或界面图片提取文字并定位文字区域的 DSH 用户。使用前需配置 API URL、API Key 和模型名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:430-437","lib/index.js:480-520","lib/client.js:273-291"]}
{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#card-en","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ocr adds OCR to DSH Web through a tool and settings card. It sends common image formats to an OpenAI-compatible or Anthropic vision API and returns text, confidence, and pixel or percentage coordinates. Low-confidence regions can be reread. Configure an API URL, key, and model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:430-437","lib/index.js:480-520","lib/client.js:273-291"]}
