{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#feature-1","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 的功能「图片 OCR 与定位」：工具调用配置的视觉模型识别图片文字，并为每项返回文字、置信度和像素或百分比坐标。输入为 PNG、JPEG、GIF 或 WebP 路径，结果可选择坐标格式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:430-437"]}
{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#feature-2","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 的功能「低置信度区域重读」：识别结果低于置信度阈值时，工具可对对应图片区域再次识别，并按区域匹配结果合并较高置信度文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:230-240"]}
{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#feature-3","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 的功能「指定区域精读」：调用者可传入像素坐标 focus_regions，让工具对图片中的指定矩形区域执行一次精读，再与初次识别结果合并。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:480-520"]}
{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#feature-4","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 的功能「Web 配置与模型列表」：设置页卡片可编辑 API 格式、URL、密钥和模型，并通过按钮拉取模型列表或测试接口连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:30-60"]}
{"unit_id":"BaihaWhite__mcp-ds-ocr#caveat-1","repo":"BaihaWhite/mcp-ds-ocr","commit":"bc9b3fdf53549e8f11e937cd27830c207a482dcd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ocr 使用识别时会把图片内容发送到配置的视觉模型 API；实际接收服务由 API URL 和协议设置决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:267-275","lib/index.js:489-500"]}
